* Wien-bridge sine oscillator — one TL072 section
* f = 1 / (2 π R C); soft diode clip for amplitude
* Pins: OUT VCC VEE
*
* Instance:  X1 out vcc vee wien_osc R=10k C=37.4n   → ~425 Hz

.subckt wien_osc OUT VCC VEE params: R=10k C=37.4n

* Series RC from OUT to bridge node B
Rs OUT A {R}
Cs A B {C}
* Parallel RC to ground
Rp B 0 {R}
Cp B 0 {C}

* Non-inverting gain ≈ 3+ with soft clip
Rgnd MINUS 0 10k
Rf OUT MINUS 22k
D1 OUT CLIP Dclamp
D2 CLIP MINUS Dclamp
Rclip CLIP MINUS 1k
.model Dclamp D(IS=1e-14 N=1.8)

Xamp B MINUS VCC VEE OUT TL072
.ic v(B)=0.1 v(A)=0

.ends wien_osc
